A fresh install starts with the "Circuit preview" project action instead of an
empty list, so every project has a one-click tscircuit preview beside the chat.
The action itself lives in overlay/packages/contracts/src/tscircuit/defaultProjectScripts.ts.

Only the default changes: a list the user has saved still wins.

